{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50303","headline":"秋（原作「夏」）日非所书情 · 佚名","name":"秋（原作「夏」）日非所书情","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自从去岁别流沙，独恨今秋归望赊。\n将谓西南穷地角，谁言东北到天涯。\n山河远近多穹帐，戎俗迢观少物华。\n六月尚闻飞雪片，三春岂见有烟花。\n凌晨倏闪奔雷电，薄暮斯须歛霁霞，傍对崇山形屹屹，前临巨壑势呀呀。\n昨来覊思忧如捣，即日愁肠乱似麻。\n爲客已遭迍否事，不知何计得还家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50303.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50303","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}